:: Fishing Moor Fox Arrive
<<effects>>
<<beastNEWinit 1 fox>><<saveNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "watching">>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness to 0>>

<<beasttype>>【이가】 헤더 덤불 속에서 종종걸음으로 나와 조금 떨어진 곳에 멈춰 서더니, 호기심 어린 반짝이는 눈으로 당신을 지켜본다.<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Fishing Moor Fox Feed
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
<<if $fishingHookedFish.size gte 80>>
	You toss the <<= fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)>> down in front of the <<beasttype>>. <<bHe>> sniffs it, clamps down, and hauls it off across the moor.
<<else>>
	You toss the <<= fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)>> to the <<beasttype>>. <<bHe>> catches it neatly and bolts off into the heather.
<</if>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">><<endevent>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Moor Fox Angry Feed
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
You shove the <<= fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)>> toward the <<beasttype>>. <<bHe>> snatches it from your hands and bolts off across the moor without looking back.
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">><<endevent>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>

:: Fishing Moor Fox Molestation
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<loadNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<beastCombatInit>>
	<<set $NPCList[0].stance to "top">>
	<<set $enemytrust to -200>>
	<<set $enemyanger to 200>>
	<<hawkRescueSetup>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<alarmstate>>
<<beast $enemyno>>
<br><br>

<<stateman>>
<br><br>

<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend or ($pain gte 100 and $willpowerpain is 0)>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Fishing Moor Fox Molestation Finish]]>><</link>></span>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Fishing Moor Fox Molestation]]>><</link>></span>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Moor Fox Molestation Finish
<<effects>>
<<if $enemypleasure gte $enemypleasuremax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>
	<<beasttype>>【은는】 혼란스러운 듯 당신에게서 떨어져 물러난다. <<bHe>>【은는】 고개를 휘저으며 헤더 덤불 속으로 사라진다.
	<<if $fishingMoorFoxPhase is 1>>
		You stow the <<= fishDisplayName(fishKeepKey($fishingHookedFish))>> safely away.
		<<run fishStow($fishingHookedFish)>>
		<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
		<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">>
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> 당신은 몸을 추스른다.
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<unset $fishingMoorFoxPhase>>
	<<link [[다시 낚시한다|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[떠난다|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif $alarm is 1 and $rescue is 1>>
	구조를 요청하는 비명에 응답이 들려온다. <<hawkScreechDesc>>【이가】 허공을 찢을 듯 울려 퍼진다. <<hawkRescueApproachSentence>>
	<br><br>

	그 소리에 움찔한 <<beasttype>>【은는】 헤더 덤불 속으로 달아난다.
	<<if $fishingMoorFoxPhase is 1>>
		You manage to hold on to the <<= fishDisplayName(fishKeepKey($fishingHookedFish))>>.
		<<run fishStow($fishingHookedFish)>>
		<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
		<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">>
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<unset $fishingMoorFoxPhase>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">><<person1>>
	<<tearful>> 당신은 하늘을 살핀다. <<if $syndromebird is 1>>당신의<<else>>한 마리의<</if>> <<beasttype>>【이가】 당신을 향해 하강하는 모습이 보인다.
	<br><br>

	<<set $phase to 0>>
	<<if $syndromebird is 1>>
		<<link [[다음|Bird Rescue Syndrome]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[다음|Bird Rescue No Syndrome]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<<beastwound>>
	<<beasttype>>【은는】 깨갱거리며 다리 사이로 꼬리를 만 채 물러나더니, 돌아서서 헤더 덤불 속으로 달아난다.
	<<if $fishingMoorFoxPhase is 1>>
		You stow the <<= fishDisplayName(fishKeepKey($fishingHookedFish))>> safely away.
		<<run fishStow($fishingHookedFish)>>
		<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
		<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">>
	<br><br>

	<<if $fishingMoorFoxPhase is 1>>
		<<tearful>> you wonder if all that was worth it for a fish.
	<<else>>
		<<tearful>> 당신은 몸을 추스른다.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<unset $fishingMoorFoxPhase>>
	<<link [[다시 낚시한다|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[떠난다|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif $pain gte 100 and $willpowerpain is 0>>
	<<if $fishingMoorFoxPhase is 1>>
		You're too battered to continue fighting as the <<beasttype>> grabs your <<= fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)>> and darts off into the heather.
		<br><br>

		<<tearful>> you wonder if all that was worth it for a fish.
		<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<<else>>
		The <<beasttype>> leaves you battered in the heather and bolts away.
		<br><br>

		<<tearful>> 당신은 몸을 추스른다.
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">>
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<unset $fishingMoorFoxPhase>>

	<<link [[다시 낚시한다|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[떠난다|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	/* No decisive outcome, such as giving up the encounter. */
	<<encounterEndViolence>>
	The <<beasttype>> loses interest in you and disappears into the heather.
	<<if $fishingMoorFoxPhase is 1>>
		You stow the <<= fishDisplayName(fishKeepKey($fishingHookedFish))>> safely away.
		<<run fishStow($fishingHookedFish)>>
		<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
		<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">>
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> 당신은 몸을 추스른다.
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<unset $fishingMoorFoxPhase>>
	<<link [[다시 낚시한다|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[떠난다|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Moor Cat Eat Fox
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
You glance at the fox, then open wide and drop the whole <<= fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)>> in your mouth. <<fishingEatFishTfProgress>><<lstress>><<stress -6>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<beasttype>>【은는】 멍하니 당신을 바라본다. 그러다 표정이 어두워지고 귀를 바짝 눕히더니, 몸을 날려 당신을 덮친다.
<br><br>

<<if animalSexEnabledForType("fox")>>
	<<link [[다음|Fishing Moor Fox Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $fishingMoorFoxPhase to 2>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	당신은 뒤로 물러나며, <<bhe>>【이가】 더 공격하기 전에 허둥지둥 쫓아낸다. 간신히 쫓아내긴 했지만 그 과정에서 발톱에 할퀴고 말았다.<<beastescape>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">><<endevent>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Moor Keep Fox
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
<<silently>><<dancedifficulty 1 1000>><</silently>>
<<if $danceSuccess>>
	The <<beasttype>> lunges for your <<= fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)>> as you unhook it, but you're able to wrench it out of reach just in time.
	<br><br>

	You stow the <<= fishDisplayName(fishKeepKey($fishingHookedFish))>> away, and the <<beasttype>> scampers back, ears flat against <<bhis>> head.
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness -= random(3, 4)>>
	<<run fishStow($fishingHookedFish)>>
	<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<else>>
	As you unhook the <<= fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)>>, the <<beasttype>> lunges and snatches it, scampering off into the heather.
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">><<endevent>>
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Fishing Moor Throw Back Fox
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
<<if animalSexEnabledForType("fox") and dangerEvent()>>
	As you toss the <<= fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)>> back, the <<beasttype>>'s eyes follow it into the water. <<bHe>> snaps <<bhis>> gaze to you, ears flat. <<bHe>> snarls, then throws <<bhimself>> at you.
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Fishing Moor Fox Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $fishingMoorFoxPhase to 2>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif $rng lt 30>>
	As you throw the <<= fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)>> back into the water, the <<beasttype>> darts forward and snatches it from the shallows before bounding off into the moor.
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">><<endevent>>
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	The <<beasttype>> watches as you throw the <<= fishDisplayName($fishingHookedFish.type)>> back into the water. <<bHis>> shoulders sag and <<bhe>> looks up at you sadly.
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[다음|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Widgets Fishing Moor Fox [widget]
<<widget "fishingMoorFoxAmbient">>
	<<loadNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
	<<set _foxMoved to false>>
	<<if $rng gte 70 and $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness lt 9 and !$daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.movedLastLoop>>
		<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness += 1>>
		<<set _foxMoved to true>>
	<</if>>
	<<cleareventpool>>
	<<if _foxMoved>>
		<<if $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness lte 2>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				<<beasttype>>【이가】 사뿐사뿐 다가와 자리를 잡고 당신을 지켜본다.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<<elseif $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness lte 5>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				<<beasttype>>【이가】 헤더 덤불 속에 몸을 낮춘 채 살금살금 다가온다.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<<elseif $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness lte 7>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				<<beasttype>>【이가】 스르륵 다가와 불과 몇 걸음 떨어진 곳에 자리를 잡는다.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<<else>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				<<beasttype>>【이가】 팔이 닿을 거리에 살금살금 다가와 땅에 바짝 엎드린다.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness lte 2>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				<<beasttype>>【이가】 헤더 덤불 가장자리에서 당신을 지켜본다.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<<elseif $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness lte 5>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				<<beasttype>>【이가】 근처 헤더 덤불 속에 몸을 웅크린 채 당신의 찌를 주시한다.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<<elseif $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness lte 7>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				<<beasttype>>【이가】 몇 걸음 떨어진 곳에 앉아, 완전히 몰입하여 당신을 빤히 바라본다.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<<else>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				<<beasttype>>【이가】 당신 옆에 미동도 없이 엎드려 낚싯줄을 뚫어지게 응시하고 있다.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<runeventpool>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.movedLastLoop to _foxMoved>>
	<<endevent>>
<</widget>>
